 that specifies an id reference."}]}]},{"name":"number","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The measure number. In partwise files, this should be the same for measures in different parts that share the same left barline. Often numeric, but not required to be; non-numeric values are typically combined with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"implicit"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"nonControlling","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" set to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":". For a pickup measure, this is typically ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"0\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with ","type":"text"},{"code":"implicit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" set to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"name":"isImplicit","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether the measure number should never appear, such as for pickup measures and the last half of mid-measure repeats. Defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" if not specified."}]}]},{"name":"isNonControlling","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A Boolean value indicating whether the left barline in this measure does not coincide with the left barline of measures in other parts, as in multimetric music like the Don Giovanni minuet. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if not specified.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The displayed measure number, when different from the value of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"number"},{"type":"text","text":". Ignored when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"implicit"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"name":"text"},{"name":"width","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The width of the measu